    {
      "path": "std::ops::Deref",
      "kind": "trait",
      "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/ops/deref/trait.Deref.html",
      "score": 62.2,
      "docs": [
        {
          "type": "truncatedBlock",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Used for immutable dereferencing operations, like ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "*v",
                  "style": "InlineCode"
                },
                {
                  "text": ".",
                  "style": "Plain"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "In addition to being used for explicit dereferencing operations with the",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "(unary) ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "*",
                  "style": "InlineCode"
                },
                {
                  "text": " operator in immutable contexts, ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Deref",
                  "style": "InlineCode"
                },
                {
                  "text": " is also used implicitly",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "by the compiler in many circumstances. This mechanism is called",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "\"",
                  "style": "Plain",
                  "url": "#deref-coercion"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Deref",
                  "style": "InlineCode",
                  "url": "#deref-coercion"
                },
                {
                  "text": " coercion\"",
                  "style": "Plain",
                  "url": "#deref-coercion"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". In mutable contexts, ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "DerefMut",
                  "style": "InlineCode",
                  "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/ops/deref/trait.DerefMut.html"
                },
                {
                  "text": " is used and",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "mutable deref coercion similarly occurs.",
                  "style": "Plain"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Warning:",
                  "style": "Strong"
                },
                {
                  "text": " Deref coercion is a powerful language feature which has",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "far-reaching implications for every type that implements ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Deref",
                  "style": "InlineCode"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". The",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "compiler will silently insert calls to ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Deref::deref",
                  "style": "InlineCode"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". For this reason, one",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "should be careful about implementing ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Deref",
                  "style": "InlineCode"
                },
                {
                  "text": " and only do so when deref",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "coercion is desirable. See ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "below",
                  "style": "Plain",
                  "url": "#when-to-implement-deref-or-derefmut"
                },
                {
                  "text": " for advice on when this is",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "typically desirable or undesirable.",
                  "style": "Plain"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "text": "Types that implement ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Deref",
                  "style": "InlineCode"
                },
                {
                  "text": " or ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "DerefMut",
                  "style": "InlineCode"
                },
                {
                  "text": " are often called \"smart",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "pointers\" and the mechanism of deref coercion has been specifically designed",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "to facilitate the pointer-like behavior that name suggests. Often, the",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "purpose of a \"smart pointer\" type is to change the ownership semantics",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "of a contained value (for example, ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Rc",
                  "style": "InlineCode",
                  "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3A%2E%2F%2E%2E%2Falloc%2Frc%2Fstruct%2ERc"
                },
                {
                  "text": " or ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Cow",
                  "style": "InlineCode",
                  "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3A%2E%2F%2E%2E%2Falloc%2Fborrow%2Fenum%2ECow"
                },
                {
                  "text": ") or the",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": " ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "storage semantics of a contained value (for example, ",
                  "style": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Box",
                  "style": "InlineCode",
                  "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3A%2E%2F%2E%2E%2Falloc%2Fboxed%2Fstruct%2EBox"
